<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-zinc-900/50">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
        About <span class="text-purple-400">Me</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="w-24 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-purple-400 mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          Hello! I'm Denis, a software engineer and system architect with more than 12 years
          of professional experience in backend development, cloud infrastructure, and full-stack
          applications.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          My career spans from leading cloud-based architectures at fintech companies
          to building microservices platforms for global e-commerce. I thrive on solving
          complex technical problems, mentoring teams, and learning new technologies that
          push boundaries.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          Outside of coding, I love spending time with my family, whether it’s hiking,
          movie nights, or just being together. When I get some free time, you’ll probably find me
          gaming or soldering together little IoT gadgets for fun.
        </p>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-4">
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border border-purple-500/30">
            🚀 Problem Solver
          </span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border border-purple-500/30">
            💡 Creative Thinker  
          </span>
          <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border border-purple-500/30">
            🎯 Detail Oriented
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-600/20 to-purple-800/20 rounded-2xl p-8 backdrop-blur-sm border border-purple-500/20">
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Experience</h3>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-zinc-300">Backend Development</span>
                  <span class="text-purple-400 font-medium">12+ years</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-zinc-300">Frontend Development</span>
                  <span class="text-purple-400 font-medium">5+ years</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                  <span class="text-zinc-300">Cloud & DevOps</span>
                  <span class="text-purple-400 font-medium">3+ years</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">Education</h3>
              <p class="text-zinc-300">
                B.S. Communication System Engineer<br>
                <span class="text-purple-400">Ben-Gurion University of the Negev</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>